# Draft only; subject to maintainer review. See the paired Markdown document.
id:                     DRAFT-tinyirc-1.1.dfsg.1-static-ncurses-terminfo-run-trait
trigger_tool:           conan|ncurses|terminfo
phase:                  packaging|runtime|testing
severity:               2
category:               ohos, conan, application, runtime-resource, terminfo
error_signature:        TERMINFO is required for the ncurses termcap database|tinyirc: no termcap entry
match_keywords:         static ncurses, package_type application, Skipped binaries ncurses, run=True, VirtualRunEnv, TERMINFO
title:                  静态 ncurses 应用仍需把 terminfo 数据依赖标为 Conan 运行依赖
root_cause:             tinyirc 静态链接 libncursesw.a 只消除了动态库加载需求；终端能力仍从 ncurses 包的 share/terminfo 数据读取。Conan 应用默认依赖特性让下游测试图跳过 ncurses 包二进制，导致其 runenv_info 中的 TERMINFO 未注入。
affected_scope:         静态链接终端库但运行时依赖 terminfo 数据的 Conan application 包；类似的字体或数据资源依赖也需单独核查运行特性
verification_cmd:       conan create archives/t/tinyirc/1.1.dfsg.1 -pr:h=ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ohos-aarch64 -r=ohpcd --build=tinyirc/1.1.dfsg.1
rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           mark-static-dependency-runtime-when-it-owns-data
rec_description:        确认依赖包提供运行时数据库及 runenv_info；对应用显式 self.requires("ncurses/6.6", run=True)，让消费者图保留依赖包并由 VirtualRunEnv 注入 TERMINFO。再用安装后的包运行真实终端能力测试，而非只检查静态链接成功。
rec_command:            conan create archives/t/tinyirc/1.1.dfsg.1 -pr:h=ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ohos-aarch64 -r=ohpcd --build=tinyirc/1.1.dfsg.1
rec_auto_fix:           false
